<h1>Quick Start Guide</h1>
<p>Get your digital signage up and running in 15 minutes. This guide walks you through every step from creating your account to displaying content on your storefront screen.</p>

<%= render "docs/shared/callout", type: "tip" do %>
  <p>Before you begin, make sure you have your player device and a TV or monitor ready.</p>
<% end %>

<h2>1. Create your account</h2>
<p>Sign up at RePlay and create your brokerage account. You'll be the account owner with full access to all features.</p>

<h2>2. Add your first site</h2>
<p>A site represents a physical location, like your office. Go to <strong>Sites</strong> and add your office address. All screens at this location will be grouped under this site.</p>

<h2>3. Add a screen</h2>
<p>A screen represents a TV or monitor at your site. Go to your site and add a screen. Give it a name like "Front Window" or "Lobby Display."</p>

<h2>4. Add a listing</h2>
<p>Go to <strong>Listings</strong> and add a property. Include the address, price, photos, and key details like bedrooms and square footage.</p>

<h2>5. Create an ad</h2>
<p>From your listing, click <strong>Create Ad</strong>. Choose a layout (hero, split, minimal, or stat grid), pick a theme, and upload a hero image. Preview it to see how it will look on screen.</p>

<h2>6. Build a playlist</h2>
<p>Go to <strong>Playlists</strong> and create one. Add your ad to the playlist and set the display duration (how long each slide shows). You can add multiple ads to create a rotation.</p>

<h2>7. Assign the playlist to your screen</h2>
<p>Go to your screen and assign the playlist you just created. The content is now ready to display.</p>

<h2>8. Pair the player device</h2>
<p>Plug in your player device and connect it to WiFi. The TV will display a 6-character pairing code. In RePlay, go to your screen and click <strong>Pair a player</strong>. Enter the code. Your content starts playing immediately.</p>

